the future of the podcast.

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:46.180
But I definitely don't want
to be remiss and miss out

00:32:46.180 --> 00:32:48.150
on saying thanks
to the listeners.

00:32:48.150 --> 00:32:49.900
It has been a delight
and a pleasure being

00:32:49.900 --> 00:32:51.442
on this podcast
journey with everyone

00:32:51.442 --> 00:32:53.200
who listens to the podcast.

00:32:53.200 --> 00:32:56.830
It is hugely, hugely warming to
hear the positive experiences

00:32:56.830 --> 00:32:58.690
that people have had
because the podcast,

00:32:58.690 --> 00:33:01.150
from people getting jobs at
Google and other companies

00:33:01.150 --> 00:33:04.360
because of the educational
content, people coming

00:33:04.360 --> 00:33:07.000
to our events that we've run
simply because of the podcast,

00:33:07.000 --> 00:33:08.470
and just many more.

00:33:08.470 --> 00:33:12.250
It is truly just a pleasure to
join you all on this journey.

00:33:12.250 --> 00:33:16.550
And it is definitely bittersweet
to be saying goodbye now.

00:33:16.550 --> 00:33:20.050
So with that being
said, for the last time,

00:33:20.050 --> 00:33:23.260
for me on the "Google
Cloud Platform Podcast,"

00:33:23.260 --> 00:33:24.880
thank you all for listening.

00:33:24.880 --> 00:33:26.710
And we'll see you all next week.

00:33:26.710 --> 00:33:29.760
[MUSIC PLAYING]

